{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27293","headline":"藩臣恋魏阙 · 蒋防","name":"藩臣恋魏阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剖竹随皇命，分忧镇大藩。\n恩波怀魏阙，献纳望天阍。\n政奉南风顺，心依北极尊。\n梦魂通玉陛，动息寄朱轩。\n直以蒸黎念，思陈政化源。\n如何子牟意，今古道斯存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}